    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41167" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισύρω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>drag</i> or <i>trail after</i> one, 
