				 <i><span class="en">
					D.L.
					1.81
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χλαμύδα λαμπράν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Posidon.
					36
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποδήρεις χιτῶνας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>VH</u>
					2.46
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φελλούς</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
