					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					4.1.10
				</span></i>
			 : —
				Pass.
			, <i>crawl</i> or <i>creep along,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τῆς γῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyn.</u>
					5.13
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				2.23
			</span></i> ; <i>to be drawn over, rub against,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήνιγγι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Heliod.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				46.19.2
			</span></i> ; <i>to be trailed on the ground,</i>
