				Just.
				<u>Nov.</u>
				42.1.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>draw gently,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ πνεῦμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alciphr.
					3.12
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>draw over oneself,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέρμα αἰγός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Longus
					3.24
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>draw up by friction,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Steph.
				<u>in Gal.</u>
				1.326D.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			
