					Luc.
					<u>DMeretr.</u>
					10.3
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φθέγγεσθαι ἐ. τι καὶ συνεχὲς καὶ</span>
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίτροχον</span>”
